  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Md. Code Ann., Public Safety § 5–306(d)): The Secretary SHALL issue a handgun qualification license, without an additional application or fee, to a person who: (1) meets the requirements for issuance of a permit under this section; and (2) does not have a handgun qualification license issued under § 5–117.1 of this title."
